GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "9B0CA35E2D237534"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{B9D85A368354A7E3}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Delta (DINGO) and Ranger Platoon (RAPTOR) have been conducting counter-insurgency operations on the island ever since we secured it from Narco-Terrorists 10 years ago."\
     ""\
     "Several warlords and terrorists groups still operate on the island. Some warlords are supported by the United States and others remain hostile."\
     ""\
     "We have received a recent intelligence report that Warlord Wade, whom we have supported in the past, is planning to secretly supply the terrorist group The Scourge of Gabriel with a VBIED for future use against coalition forces. They plan to meet at OBJ WINDY GOAT in the warlord's compound grid 019074. The villa is the most likely meeting place."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF" "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E03FC5BA05AAB58B}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "The Americans invaded our island 10 years ago and have been conducting counter-insurgency operations ever since."\
     ""\
     "We want them and their puppet government gone."\
     ""\
     "Warlord Wade has decided to provide the terorrist group The Scourge of Gabriel with a VBIED to kick off a terrorist attack later this week."\
     ""\
     "Wade's Villa has been chosen to exchange money and the VBIED. The Americans will never see this coming!"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST" "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{98B932E01BD3B31B}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "COTVT Windy Goat"\
     ""\
     "Delta (DINGO) and Ranger Platoon (RAPTOR) have been conducting counter-insurgency operations on the island ever since we secured it from Narco-Terrorists 10 years ago."\
     ""\
     "Several warlords and terrorists groups still operate on the island. Some warlords are supported by the United States and others remain hostile."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0FA398247C9E5447}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "MISSION: Capture HVTs Gabe and Wade alive. They are expected to meet at the Villa located at grid 019074. Extract them to the hangar at the airbase."\
     ""\
     "DINGO and RAPTOR are to plan a joint operation to capture Wade and Gabe alive. Our intelligence agencies tell us they are meeting at the villa marked by OBJ WINDY GOAT to exchange money for the VBIED."\
     ""\
     "Capture Wade and Gabe alive and extract them to the hangar at the airbase for complete and total US Victory."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "If Wade and Gabe are killed by US forces we risk an armed uprising on the island."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF" "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2922E1D92C8C27C6}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Establish security inside of the villa building. Wait for the terrorist leader Gabriel to arrive."\
     "We spawn at the villa grid 019074"\
     ""\
     "Once Gabriel arrives, welcome him inside and get your money from him. We expect that his van has the $5m payment inside. Negotiate and get more money for the VBIED."\
     ""\
     "We are friendly with Gabriel and his terrorist group. We expect to support him in his upcoming fight against the Americans."\
     ""\
     "Defend the villa building and Wade at all costs. We should not abandon the Villa building any surrounding area. Deserters should be killed."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Wade's note: There is no VBIED. We lied to Gabe. There is a truck out front we can give them for the money instead. Don't let them find out its a fake."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3B6F3C9EF7A5CB5F}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "We stopped for a smoke break at grid 034069"\
     ""\
     "Continue driving to the villa. We will meet with Warlord Wade and give him money in exchange for the VBIED. He is expecting us."\
     ""\
     "Negotiate the price down as much as possible. Do not exchange money without a demonstration of a working VBIED. Our contact told us the van parked out front is the test VBIED. Ask for a demonstration. We were told the truck parked nearby is the VBIED we can use."\
     ""\
     "We must be friendly with Wade and his men. We need all the support we can get to fight the Americans."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4BEE69BB6F21B898}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "We are all located at Joint Base Edwards. Grid 026053."\
     "DINGO is assigned to the UH-60 helicopters."\
     ""\
     "LOAD PLAN"\
     "DINGO is to utilize both UH-60s which hold 11 each plus the co-pilot seat (12 total). Each UH-60 has 2 crew for gunners. There is room for all of DINGO."\
     ""\
     "RAPTOR is assigned to the ground vehicles. RAPTOR 1, 2, and 3 have 2x M2 JLTVs each. RAPTOR 4 has 1x truck and RAPTOR 0 has an unarmed JLTV."\
     ""\
     "COMPOSITION"\
     "DINGO - 1x Delta Forces group"\
     "RAPTOR - 1x Ranger Platoon"\
     "HAWK 6 - Flight of 2x UH-60 Blackhawks"\
     ""\
     "ASSETS"\
     "6x Armed JLTVs"\
     "1x Unarmed JLTV"\
     "1x Transport Truck"\
     ""\
     "2x armed UH-60 Blackhawks"\
     "No resupply for UH-60 Blackhawks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF" "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DFA7741EBA176A7D}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "The Villa (Objective Windy Goat): grid 019074"\
     ""\
     "The Scourge of Gabriel"\
     "We expect the terrorist leader, Gabe, to arrive shortly. He will ingress with a small convoy and several body guards. Small arms only."\
     ""\
     "Warlord Wade"\
     "We expect the Warlord's compound to be heavily defended by paid fighters with small arms and several RPGs we supplied them previously. Wade is usually unarmed or armed with a sidearm only."\
     ""\
     "No AAA or armored vehicles are expected. "\
     ""\
     "Small groups of the warlord's fighters have been seen roaming the warlord's compound."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF" "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FCD1E9D4FBA61ECD}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "RAPTOR 0 is mission commander"\
     "2IC DINGO 0"\
     ""\
     "DINGO - 42 Mhz"\
     "RAPTOR - 43 Mhz"\
     ""\
     "AIR/SHARED NET - 40 Mhz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF" "US"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{52707AE51DB8A524}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "Ranger PLT Lead is overall mission commander."\
     ""\
     "Some amount of roleplay expected by \"Wade\" and \"Gabe\"."\
     ""\
     "US Major Victory if Gabe and Wade extracted alive."\
     ""\
     "US Minor Victory if Gabe and Wade are KIA."\
     ""\
     "Blufor can choose time of day. Weather random."\
     ""\
     "GMs can fix things if required."\
     ""\
     "Mission by Huska"
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
